.secret-archive/
asol-secrets-manifest.json

# The recovery key for the portable secrets archive. `secrets:backup` writes it beside
# `config/secret-archive-latest.zip.enc`, and it was tracked alongside it until now — on a
# public repository, which put the ciphertext and the key that opens it in the same place.
# The key file is itself passphrase-encrypted, so this was never a plaintext leak, but
# publishing both reduced the whole archive to one offline passphrase guess.
# The encrypted archive stays tracked; the key travels out of band.
config/secret-archive-latest.zip.enc.private-key.pem


